%S A398958 1,4,30,261,2717,30265,351618,4206544,51430531,639620629,8065497675
%N A398958 Number of one-sided polyforms with n cells in the Josehedron honeycomb.
%C A398958 Polyforms in the Josehedron honeycomb (see A398957 for the definition and the honeycomb), counted up to translation and the 12 proper rotations of the honeycomb's point group.
%C A398958 The cubic-honeycomb analog of this sequence is A000162, which the same enumerator reproduces exactly for n <= 10.
%H A398958 Mathias Bernhard, <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07160">The Josehedron: A space-filling plesiohedron based on the Fischer-Koch S Triply Periodic Minimal Surface</a>, arXiv:2604.07160 [cs.CG], 2026.
%Y A398958 Cf. A398957 (fixed), A385028, A397708, A397709; A000162 (cubic analog).
